decision 4; revised after the phase B verifier rejection of the earlier do-nothing lease).

Production, one add-only delegating method: GpuCallPacker.acquireForCall, which
GpuCallPackerTest calls (1f8ce3e01, b9abcaf97). It delegates to sessions.acquire(request), which
is the dispatch every encoder call site in 481434f82 performed for a call (SpladeEncoder,
OnnxEmbeddingEncoder, CrossEncoderReranker, BertNerInference; 1f8ce3e01 replaced exactly those
sessions.acquire(acquisition) calls with acquireForCall). It adds no packing and no CPU
selection, so the check observes the old dispatch. No production code in this state calls it.

